      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسْنِيخٌ</span></b>  The <i>seeking, desiring,</i> or <i>demanding,</i>
a thing. (K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنَّخَ مِنْهُ الشَّىْءَ</span> <i>He
sought, desired,</i> or <i>demanded, from him the
thing.</i> (TK.)

